      "amount": "1/2 teaspoon"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the lamb and cook until it is browned on all sides.",
    "Add the bhuna spice mix and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the tomato paste and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the ciabatta cubes and stir to combine.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Cook for an additional 5 minutes or until the ciabatta is toasted.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
